{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Speck family's restaurant is in shambles after its sous chef, Juniper Speck, mysteriously vanishes in the night. News of sudden monster attacks spreads throughout the country, and a mega popular fast food chain pops up in a sleepy town. Meanwhile, Jin Speck and an unusual talking slime are on the run after being framed for murder. Follow their journey as they sleuth through various small towns, working undercover at mom and pop restaurants and learning new cooking techniques along the way. Will you uncover the mystery behind the missing chef and save the family restaurant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217720/extras/51c5ed29fe3c215dbfeb6ffb647b9b68.avif?t=1738096627\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217720/extras_big/51c5ed29fe3c215dbfeb6ffb647b9b68.avif?t=1738096627 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets in a beautiful and mysterious world while you <strong>puzzle</strong>, <strong>cook</strong>, and <strong>fight</strong> your way through different towns to find your missing sister and clear your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217720/extras/26d96f1c91b736cc41cb933150a7a823.avif?t=1738096627\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217720/extras/5de5d66e102b6f302e4af9c52d01ba6e.webp?t=1738096627\" width=25 height=25 /></span> Gather evidence by talking to NPCs to uncover the mystery behind Juniper\u2019s disappearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><sp